    "description": "If you have a plan from HomeServe, you can easily manage your HomeServe account from your mobile device 24/7/365. \r\n\r\nSimply log in to My Account with your HomeServe ID and you\u2019ll get quick access to:  \r\n- View your existing HomeServe plans  \r\n- Make payments  \r\n- Update payment methods  \r\n- Go paperless  \r\n- Reset HomeServe ID password  \r\n- Add/cancel coverage \r\n- Schedule service \r\n- View service history \r\n- Chat with a HomeServe representative \r\nSome features must be accessed through a link in the app to our website.",
